            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Ayala, V. (2022).  It Takes a Village… and More: Southeast Los Angeles as a Model for Alleviating Infrastructure Deficits and Environmental Injustice Through Community-Based Resistance. Unpublished Honors Thesis. Stanford University, Stanford CA. ",
